# Immutable Windows subprocess captures retain their original CR/CRLF bytes.
# Their exact raw and Git-clean hashes are recorded in integration-verifier-portability.json.
# Whitespace lint does not rewrite historical evidence; source files keep normal checks.
commit-verifier-*.log -whitespace
metadata-verifier-pre-*.log -whitespace
metadata-verifier-post-*.log -whitespace
